#: ../../docs/login/login-inter.rst:5 70bec3396d9e4dd1b0e554ba0d88c98a
msgid "Internal User Login"
msgstr "Internal User Login"

#: ../../docs/login/login-inter.rst:9 2ddf0d08170942d9a74675f1b7628cbf
msgid ""
"本页面已过时。新版 web 平台登录流程请参考 :doc:`login`（账号密码登"
"录）、:doc:`register`（注册账号） 和 :doc:`workbench`（登录后的工作台）。本文"
"件保留以便查阅 旧版登录方式，仅供参考。"
msgstr ""
"This page is outdated. For the current web platform login flow, "
"see :doc:`login` (username and password), :doc:`register` (account "
"registration), and :doc:`workbench` (workbench after login). This file is "
"kept for reference to legacy login methods only."

#: ../../docs/login/login-inter.rst:16 fd71a3839e6a41f983ab6dd66b574889
msgid ""
"After successfully establishing a network connection with cnSRC , in order "
"to further ensure the security of user data, cnSRC does not allow users to "
"log in to the server using telnet, etc., and must use the ssh login method "
"to use the center's resources."
msgstr ""
"After successfully establishing a network connection with cnSRC , in order "
"to further ensure the security of user data, cnSRC does not allow users to "
"log in to the server using telnet, etc., and must use the ssh login method "
"to use the center's resources."

#: ../../docs/login/login-inter.rst:24 174a53f88347453f86875d1ea7256144
msgid ""
"Regarding user password, the administrator sends a random password to the "
"user. For user access security, the account must be modified immediately "
"after opening. Please visit the following website to modify the password in "
"the web page: https://kylin.cnsrc.shao.ac.cn/"
msgstr ""
"Regarding user password, the administrator sends a random password to the "
"user. For user access security, the account must be modified immediately "
"after opening. Please visit the following website to modify the password in "
"the web page: https://kylin.cnsrc.shao.ac.cn/"

#: ../../docs/login/login-inter.rst:27 220878ce2fc74b38a24ec8233629a7d0
msgid ""
"There are two ways to log in to cnSRC: web login and command line login."
msgstr ""
"There are two ways to log in to cnSRC: web login and command line login."

