msgstr "Dear user xxx,"

#: ../../docs/login/login-inter.rst:76 197845dcc59c409aac24cda4429092fb
msgid ""
"您的注册申请已经审批通过，请使用用户名 xxx 、Token \\****\\* 及申请注册时所设"
"置的密码进行登录。"
msgstr ""
"Your registration application has been approved. Please log in with username "
"xxx, Token \\****\\*, and the password you set when registering."

#: ../../docs/login/login-inter.rst:79 9ada052a32934b86a0e901c613dfd713
msgid "收到这样的邮件，就表示已经通过用户审批，可以登录使用平台了。"
msgstr ""
"Receiving such an email means your registration has been approved and you "
"can log in to the platform."

#: ../../docs/login/login-inter.rst:82 4dc40600986a48c796a2719b66f6ef3e
