msgstr "First login"

#: ../../docs/login/login-inter.rst:84 577e5c11c52a487ca945dcd8f645e911
msgid ""
"In order to verify that the email is the email of the registered user, so, "
"when the user first logs in, they need to use the verification code received "
"by email to log in."
msgstr ""
"In order to verify that the email is the email of the registered user, so, "
"when the user first logs in, they need to use the verification code received "
"by email to log in."

#: ../../docs/login/login-inter.rst:86 5fcac49d85314b0ca0ad3060e22ef3be
msgid ""
"Enter the username directly, the system will judge that the user is a first-"
"time login user, and automatically jump to the interface for using the "
"username and verification code to log in."
msgstr ""
"Enter the username directly, the system will judge that the user is a first-"
"time login user, and automatically jump to the interface for using the "
"username and verification code to log in."

#: ../../docs/login/login-inter.rst:88 4c1e8aefcadf424abe978e4919fb5645
msgid ""
"Enter the username and the verification code received by email, click "
"\"Login\" to log in."
msgstr ""
"Enter the username and the verification code received by email, click "
"\"Login\" to log in."

