#: ../../docs/login/login-inter.rst:122 39b359865a9c42f4b7eebccce3ce617d
msgid ""
"Each user is allocated a certain amount of resources. When creating an "
"instance, the resource limit is occupied. If the resources used exceed the "
"limit, the system will prompt that the resources are insufficient. Users can "
"first \\ :ref:`release resource <release resource>`\\ , and then create an "
"instance."
msgstr ""
"Each user is allocated a certain amount of resources. When creating an "
"instance, the resource limit is occupied. If the resources used exceed the "
"limit, the system will prompt that the resources are insufficient. Users can "
"first \\ :ref:`release resource <release resource>`\\ , and then create an "
"instance."

#: ../../docs/login/login-inter.rst:124 bdf4d97b803a42aa99f1c853fd46caaf
msgid ""
"If you need more resources, and exceed the system default limit, users can "
"contact the administrator to modify the personal limit."
msgstr ""
"If you need more resources, and exceed the system default limit, users can "
"contact the administrator to modify the personal limit."

